ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja475:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja475:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja475:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja475:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja475:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja475:14.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja475:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja475:0.2": "Terasakanipāta ", "ja475:0.3": "Ambavagga ", "ja475:0.4": "2. Phandanajātaka ", "ja475:1.1": "“Kuṭhārihattho puriso, ", "ja475:1.2": "vanamogayha tiṭṭhasi; ", "ja475:1.3": "Puṭṭho me samma akkhāhi, ", "ja475:1.4": "kiṁ dāruṁ chetumicchasi”. ", "ja475:2.1": "“Isso vanāni carasi, ", "ja475:2.2": "samāni visamāni ca; ", "ja475:2.3": "Puṭṭho me samma akkhāhi, ", "ja475:2.4": "kiṁ dāruṁ nemiyā daḷhaṁ”. ", "ja475:3.1": "“Neva sālo na khadiro, ", "ja475:3.2": "nāssakaṇṇo kuto dhavo; ", "ja475:3.3": "Rukkho ca phandano nāma, ", "ja475:3.4": "taṁ dāruṁ nemiyā daḷhaṁ”. ", "ja475:4.1": "“Kīdisānissa pattāni, ", "ja475:4.2": "khandho vā pana kīdiso; ", "ja475:4.3": "Puṭṭho me samma akkhāhi, ", "ja475:4.4": "yathā jānemu phandanaṁ”. ", "ja475:5.1": "“Yassa sākhā palambanti, ", "ja475:5.2": "namanti na ca bhañjare; ", "ja475:5.3": "So rukkho phandano nāma, ", "ja475:5.4": "yassa mūle ahaṁ ṭhito. ", "ja475:6.1": "Arānaṁ cakkanābhīnaṁ, ", "ja475:6.2": "īsānemirathassa ca; ", "ja475:6.3": "Sabbassa te kammaniyo, ", "ja475:6.4": "ayaṁ hessati phandano”. ", "ja475:7.1": "“Iti phandanarukkhopi, ", "ja475:7.2": "tāvade ajjhabhāsatha; ", "ja475:7.3": "Mayhampi vacanaṁ atthi, ", "ja475:7.4": "bhāradvāja suṇohi me. ", "ja475:8.1": "Issassa upakkhandhamhā, ", "ja475:8.2": "Ukkacca caturaṅgulaṁ; ", "ja475:8.3": "Tena nemiṁ pasāresi, ", "ja475:8.4": "Evaṁ daḷhataraṁ siyā. ", "ja475:9.1": "Iti phandanarukkhopi, ", "ja475:9.2": "veraṁ appesi tāvade; ", "ja475:9.3": "Jātānañca ajātānaṁ, ", "ja475:9.4": "issānaṁ dukkhamāvahi. ", "ja475:10.1": "Iccevaṁ phandano issaṁ, ", "ja475:10.2": "isso ca pana phandanaṁ; ", "ja475:10.3": "Aññamaññaṁ vivādena, ", "ja475:10.4": "aññamaññamaghātayuṁ. ", "ja475:11.1": "Evameva manussānaṁ, ", "ja475:11.2": "vivādo yattha jāyati; ", "ja475:11.3": "Mayūranaccaṁ naccanti, ", "ja475:11.4": "yathā te issaphandanā. ", "ja475:12.1": "Taṁ vo vadāmi bhaddaṁ vo, ", "ja475:12.2": "yāvantettha samāgatā; ", "ja475:12.3": "Sammodatha mā vivadatha, ", "ja475:12.4": "mā hotha issaphandanā. ", "ja475:13.1": "Sāmaggimeva sikkhetha, ", "ja475:13.2": "buddhehetaṁ pasaṁsitaṁ; ", "ja475:13.3": "Sāmaggirato dhammaṭṭho, ", "ja475:13.4": "yogakkhemā na dhaṁsatī”ti. ", "ja475:14.1": "Phandanajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja475:0.1": "", "ja475:0.2": "", "ja475:0.3": "", "ja475:0.4": "", "ja475:1.1": "Kuṭhārihattho → kudhārihattho (mr) ", "ja475:1.2": "", "ja475:1.3": "", "ja475:1.4": "", "ja475:2.1": "Isso → iso (si); īso (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja475:2.2": "", "ja475:2.3": "", "ja475:2.4": "", "ja475:3.1": "", "ja475:3.2": "", "ja475:3.3": "Rukkho ca → rukkhova (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja475:3.4": "", "ja475:4.1": "", "ja475:4.2": "", "ja475:4.3": "", "ja475:4.4": "", "ja475:5.1": "", "ja475:5.2": "", "ja475:5.3": "", "ja475:5.4": "", "ja475:6.1": "", "ja475:6.2": "", "ja475:6.3": "", "ja475:6.4": "", "ja475:7.1": "", "ja475:7.2": "", "ja475:7.3": "", "ja475:7.4": "", "ja475:8.1": "Issassa → imassa (si, mr) | upakkhandhamhā → upakhandhamhā (bj, pts-vp-pli1, mr) ", "ja475:8.2": "", "ja475:8.3": "pasāresi → pariharesi (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja475:8.4": "", "ja475:9.1": "", "ja475:9.2": "", "ja475:9.3": "", "ja475:9.4": "", "ja475:10.1": "Iccevaṁ → icceva (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja475:10.2": "", "ja475:10.3": "", "ja475:10.4": "", "ja475:11.1": "", "ja475:11.2": "", "ja475:11.3": "", "ja475:11.4": "", "ja475:12.1": "bhaddaṁ vo → bhaddante (mr) ", "ja475:12.2": "", "ja475:12.3": "vivadatha → māvivadittha (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja475:12.4": "", "ja475:13.1": "Sāmaggimeva → sāmagyameva (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja475:13.2": "", "ja475:13.3": "", "ja475:13.4": "", "ja475:14.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja475:0.1": "", "ja475:0.2": "", "ja475:0.3": "", "ja475:0.4": "", "ja475:1.1": "bj30.446, dr27.344, ms22J_2398, msdiv14, pts-vp-pli4.208, sya27.345", "ja475:1.2": "", "ja475:1.3": "", "ja475:1.4": "", "ja475:2.1": "ms22J_2399, msdiv15, pts-vp-pli4.209", "ja475:2.2": "", "ja475:2.3": "", "ja475:2.4": "", "ja475:3.1": "ms22J_2400, msdiv16", "ja475:3.2": "", "ja475:3.3": "", "ja475:3.4": "", "ja475:4.1": "ms22J_2401, msdiv17", "ja475:4.2": "", "ja475:4.3": "", "ja475:4.4": "", "ja475:5.1": "ms22J_2402, msdiv18", "ja475:5.2": "", "ja475:5.3": "", "ja475:5.4": "", "ja475:6.1": "ms22J_2403, msdiv19", "ja475:6.2": "", "ja475:6.3": "", "ja475:6.4": "", "ja475:7.1": "ms22J_2404, msdiv20, pts-vp-pli4.210", "ja475:7.2": "", "ja475:7.3": "", "ja475:7.4": "", "ja475:8.1": "ms22J_2405, msdiv21", "ja475:8.2": "", "ja475:8.3": "", "ja475:8.4": "", "ja475:9.1": "ms22J_2406, msdiv22, ndp22.252", "ja475:9.2": "", "ja475:9.3": "", "ja475:9.4": "", "ja475:10.1": "csp1ed22.260, csp2ed22.260, dr27.345, ms22J_2407, msdiv23, pts-vp-pli4.211, sya27.346", "ja475:10.2": "", "ja475:10.3": "", "ja475:10.4": "", "ja475:11.1": "ms22J_2408, msdiv24", "ja475:11.2": "", "ja475:11.3": "", "ja475:11.4": "", "ja475:12.1